<title>HONG KONG: S. Korea's Gateway Investment mandates $30 mln FRN.</title>
<headline>S. Korea's Gateway Investment mandates $30 mln FRN.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gateway Investment Ltd has formally mandated Korea First Bank to arrange a US$30 million floating rate note issue, bankers said.</p>
<p>They said the issuer is a wholly-owned company of Dong Bang Peregrine Securities, which will act as the guarantor of the deal.</p>
<p>The facility will have a final maturity of three years with no puts or calls options.</p>
<p>Further details are not available yet.</p>
<p>--Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2847 4039</p>
</text>
